@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5096
@apiKey = devkey
@userId = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### The connection, the sync log and the next sync
GET {{HostAddress}}/connection?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Connect Trading 212 (checked with Trading 212 unless DemoMode)
POST {{HostAddress}}/connection
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{ "userId": "{{userId}}", "apiKey": "<key>", "apiSecret": "<secret>", "environment": "live" }

### What the sync reads
POST {{HostAddress}}/connection/options
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{ "userId": "{{userId}}", "syncPositions": true, "syncOrders": true, "syncDividends": true, "syncTransactions": true }

### Sync now
POST {{HostAddress}}/connection/sync?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Import a Trading 212 CSV export (the raw file as the body)
POST {{HostAddress}}/connection/csv?userId={{userId}}
Content-Type: text/csv
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

< ../../../../.github/scripts/sample-export.csv

### Forget the key
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/connection?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Delete everything imported
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/connection/data?userId={{userId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
